          "level": 1,
          "text": "Essilor® Stellest® lenses for Myopia",
          "html": "Essilor® Stellest® lenses for Myopia",
          "id": "HIND4nFkOx",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If your child’s prescription keeps changing, you’re probably wondering what you can do to stay ahead of it. <a href=\"/eye-care-services/myopia-management/\">Myopia</a> is common in kids, and it often progresses over time, but there are ways to help slow it down. Stellest® lenses are designed to do just that, offering a simple, research-backed option that fits easily into your child’s daily routine.</p>",
          "id": "xc5XEKCS7y",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
