        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What Makes Stellest® Lenses Different",
          "html": "What Makes Stellest® Lenses Different",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "FgZn6JFWt7",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Stellest® lenses are designed specifically for myopia management, not just vision correction. While standard glasses help your child see clearly, Stellest® lenses are built with advanced technology that helps slow the rate at which their prescription changes. It’s a way to support your child’s vision while also thinking about their long-term eye health.</p>",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "ELj5z9NKtj",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
