      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "The Importance of Slowing Myopia Progression",
          "html": "The Importance of Slowing Myopia Progression",
          "id": "gXvBcj5cx6",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>When myopia continues to progress, prescriptions can become stronger over time, and that can increase the risk of eye health issues later in life.</p><p>The goal of myopia management is to slow that progression early, while your child’s eyes are still developing. Starting sooner can make a meaningful difference down the road.</p>",
          "id": "q35kzCm1Ge",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
