          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "How Stellest® lenses Help Manage Myopia",
          "html": "How Stellest® lenses Help Manage Myopia",
          "id": "wVguRysaNe",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Stellest® lenses work by adjusting how light enters the eye. This helps slow the eye’s growth, which is what leads to worsening myopia. The best part is, your child wears them just like regular glasses, no extra steps and no complicated routines.</p>",
          "id": "uo5QbaCBpy",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
