          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Stellest® lenses are designed to fit easily into your child’s daily routine while supporting their long-term vision:</p><ul><li>Worn just like regular prescription glasses</li><li>Comfortable for school, activities, and everyday wear</li><li>Helps slow changes in your child’s prescription</li><li>Backed by advanced myopia control lens technology</li></ul>",
